WEBVTT

00:09:56.202 --> 00:10:01.464
So if a 15 year-old who didn't even know
what a pancreas was

00:10:01.488 --> 00:10:04.229
could find a new way
to detect pancreatic cancer --

00:10:05.451 --> 00:10:07.149
just imagine what you could do.

00:10:07.376 --> 00:10:08.614
Thank you.

00:10:08.638 --> 00:10:15.337
(Applause)